{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-f43b318d22e9f8931bb23d5561545f4f5fb5303af8d2bd3b","family_id":"KR:013050","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"ACT ON MANAGEMENT OF FIREFIGHTING EQUIPMENT","title_original":"소방장비관리법","kind":"법률","source_version":"245289","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=245289","source_sha256":"25ba510e1072cf12127e64686af78aaa90cbfc93d07098344d561859f48ffdd9","body_sha256":"4c57dc65a7e5eb2170a64b3d76444c227afbeb34b31bfd3e502adb9768ee86de","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 9 (Listing of Fire Equipment) (1) Where fire equipment that a fire service agency has or intends to acquire is not included in the commodity list under subparagraph 2 of Article 2 of the Act on the Management and Use of Information on Commodity Lists, the head of the fire service agency shall notify the Administrator of the Public Procurement Service of necessary data for listing the concerned fire equipment in the commodity list and require the listing, as prescribed by Ordinance of the Ministry of the Interior and Safety.\n  (2) When listing of fire equipment pursuant to the request under paragraph (1) is completed, the head of a fire service agency shall notify the outcome to the Fire Commissioner of the National Fire Agency.","metadata":{"author_checks":["All current held source unit text, source editorial notes, amounts, periods, exceptions and source omission boundaries compared.","Unchanged official English retained only in the recorded exact source/target spans; original row, role, provider, edition, links and receipts remain unchanged.","New affected units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION / UNREVIEWED; source graphics remain linked to actual unchanged assets.","Source unit keys, order and full-text SHA matched the frozen inventory."],"author_method":"Exact verified reuse of existing official English spans plus assistant-authored corrections/new ma